<p class="oil-note oil-notice">Adjustment အဝင် / အထွက်ကို Warehouse Supervisor → Warehouse Accountant အစဉ်လိုက် အတည်ပြုပြီးမှ Balance ထဲ ပေါင်းပါမည်။ Pending / Rejected များကို မတွက်ပါ။</p>
<div class="oil-table-wrap"><table class="oil-table"><thead><tr><% for(const h of ['Date','Vr No','Item Code','Item Name','Type','Status','Action','Qty · g','From','To','Remark','Entered By','Supervisor','Accountant']){ %><th><%= h %></th><% } %></tr></thead><tbody>
<% r.rows.forEach(tx=>{const stage=tx.approval_status;const canApprove=(user.role==='warehouse_supervisor'&&stage==='PENDING_SUPERVISOR'||user.role==='warehouse_accountant'&&stage==='PENDING_ACCOUNTANT')&&Number(tx.created_by)!==Number(user.id)&&!(user.role==='warehouse_accountant'&&Number(tx.supervisor_by)===Number(user.id)); %>
<tr><td><%= tx.day %></td><td><%= tx.voucher %></td><td><%= tx.code %></td><td><%= tx.name %></td><td><%= tx.direction %></td><td><%= ({PENDING_SUPERVISOR:'Pending Supervisor',PENDING_ACCOUNTANT:'Pending Accountant',APPROVED:'Approved',REJECTED:'Rejected'})[stage] %></td><td><% if(canApprove){ %><form method="post" action="/inventory/raw-oil/adjustments/<%= tx.id %>/approve"><input type="hidden" name="_csrf" value="<%= csrf %>"><button>Approve</button></form><form method="post" action="/inventory/raw-oil/adjustments/<%= tx.id %>/reject"><input type="hidden" name="_csrf" value="<%= csrf %>"><button>Reject</button></form><% }else if(stage==='APPROVED'){ %><a href="/inventory/raw-oil/transactions/<%= tx.id %>">View Transaction</a><% }else{ %>—<% } %></td><td><%= fmt(tx.qty_grams) %></td><td><%= tx.direction==='IN'?tx.place:'Warehouse' %></td><td><%= tx.direction==='IN'?'Warehouse':tx.place %></td><td><%= tx.remark %></td><td><%= tx.entered_by %></td><td><%= tx.supervisor_name||'—' %><br><%= tx.supervisor_at||'' %></td><td><%= tx.accountant_name||'—' %><br><%= tx.accountant_at||'' %></td></tr>
<% });if(!r.rows.length){ %><tr><td colspan="14">Adjustment မှတ်တမ်း မရှိသေးပါ။</td></tr><% } %></tbody></table></div>
<div class="oil-pagination"><span><%= r.total %> adjustments · Page <%= r.pageNo %></span><div><% if(r.pageNo>1){ %><a href="?p=<%= r.pageNo-1 %>">Previous</a><% }if(r.pageNo*50<r.total){ %><a href="?p=<%= r.pageNo+1 %>">Next</a><% } %></div></div>
